 ıhtilât etme.</p><p>Bunları bırak emri, onlarla muaşeret ve ıhtilâttan meni' ve « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"416\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 415.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 13.6 21.7 21.7 30.7 39.7 48.0 48.0 63.7 77.3 77.3 86.3 86.3 93.7 109.6 109.6 118.6 118.6 126.7 133.6 133.6 141.7 157.6 164.3 172.6 172.6 179.3 191.3 191.3 207.0 218.3 218.3 218.3 225.0 246.0 252.7 261.0 261.0 267.7 274.6 274.6 281.3 288.0 305.3 312.0 320.3 320.3 333.7 342.0 342.0 354.7 370.6 370.6 379.6 379.6 388.6 388.6 396.7 405.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"3.0 30.7 86.3 126.7 141.7 184.6 225.0 267.7 281.3 288.0 354.7 396.7 405.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » kabilinden onları bir tehdid ve inzar olduğuna ve yoksa «inzar etme, bir şey söyleme» demek olmadığına işareten buyuruluyor ki: <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"366\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 365.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.7 39.0 50.3 62.3 69.7 85.6 85.6 85.6 102.0 120.7 141.0 147.7 156.7 156.7 172.6 189.7 189.7 196.6 212.3 234.7 234.7 241.6 241.6 257.3 257.3 267.7 283.6 283.6 283.6 290.3 290.3 306.0 306.0 313.6 313.6 313.6 324.7 332.3 354.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"102.0 108.7 108.7 120.7 147.7 172.6 196.6 212.3 222.7 222.7 267.7 324.7 332.3 340.6\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.